## KMU Resolution #704 (30.08.2017) — Base salary amount

```catala
declaration scope KMU704BaseAmount:
  output base_salary_amount content money

scope KMU704BaseAmount:
  definition base_salary_amount equals $1762
```

## Appendix 12 — Conscript monthly allowance by tariff grade

```catala
declaration scope KMU704ConscriptAllowance:
  input conscript_tariff_grade content ConscriptTariffGrade
  output conscript_monthly_allowance content money

scope KMU704ConscriptAllowance:
  label grade_i exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_I
    consequence equals $350

  label grade_ii exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_II
    consequence equals $420

  label grade_iii exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_III
    consequence equals $490

  label grade_iv exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_IV
    consequence equals $560

  label grade_v exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_V
    consequence equals $630

  label grade_vi exception default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance under condition
    conscript_tariff_grade = Grade_VI
    consequence equals $700

  label default_conscript_allowance
  definition conscript_monthly_allowance equals $0
```

