## Appendix 16 — Length of service allowance

```catala
declaration scope KMU704LengthOfServiceAllowance:
  input service_years content integer
  input position_salary content money
  input rank_allowance content money
  output length_of_service_allowance content money

scope KMU704LengthOfServiceAllowance:
  label los_25_plus exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 25
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 50 / 100

  label los_20_25 exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 20 and service_years < 25
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 45 / 100

  label los_15_20 exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 15 and service_years < 20
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 40 / 100

  label los_10_15 exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 10 and service_years < 15
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 35 / 100

  label los_5_10 exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 5 and service_years < 10
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 30 / 100

  label los_1_5 exception default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance under condition
    service_years >= 1 and service_years < 5
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 25 / 100

  label default_los
  definition length_of_service_allowance equals $0
```

## Service peculiarity bonus

```catala
declaration scope KMU704ServicePeculiarityBonus:
  input position_salary content money
  input rank_allowance content money
  input special_service_category content YesNo
  output service_peculiarity_bonus content money

scope KMU704ServicePeculiarityBonus:
  label special_100_pct exception default_peculiarity
  definition service_peculiarity_bonus under condition
    special_service_category = Yes
    consequence equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 100 / 100

  label default_peculiarity
  definition service_peculiarity_bonus equals (position_salary + rank_allowance) * 65 / 100
```

## Total monetary provision

```catala
declaration scope KMU704TotalMonetaryProvision:
  input position_or_conscript_allowance content money
  input rank_allowance_amount content money
  input length_of_service_amount content money
  input service_peculiarity_amount content money
  output total_monetary_provision content money

scope KMU704TotalMonetaryProvision:
  definition total_monetary_provision equals
    position_or_conscript_allowance + rank_allowance_amount +
    length_of_service_amount + service_peculiarity_amount
```

## Discharge assistance (Article 34)

```catala
declaration scope KMU704DischargeAssistance:
  input position_salary content money
  input is_orphan content YesNo
  output discharge_assistance_amount content money

scope KMU704DischargeAssistance:
  label orphan_12x exception default_discharge
  definition discharge_assistance_amount under condition
    is_orphan = Yes
    consequence equals position_salary * 12

  label default_discharge
  definition discharge_assistance_amount equals position_salary * 8
```
